@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Blazor Admin Panel</h1>

<p>Welcome to the Blazor Admin Panel - a Blazor WebAssembly application inspired by ng-admin.</p>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">📝 Posts Management</h5>
                <p class="card-text">View, create, edit, and delete blog posts. Explore sample API endpoints with full CRUD operations.</p>
                <a href="/posts" class="btn btn-primary">Manage Posts</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">👥 Users Management</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Browse through users and view their details. Demonstrating API GET requests for listing and individual resources.</p>
                <a href="/users" class="btn btn-primary">View Users</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-4">
    <h3>Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>✅ RESTful API integration with JSONPlaceholder</li>
        <li>✅ CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)</li>
        <li>✅ Data listing with tables</li>
        <li>✅ Detail views with related data</li>
        <li>✅ Responsive design with Bootstrap</li>
        <li>✅ Clean navigation and routing</li>
    </ul>
</div>
